    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T14:11:29Z",
    "body": "You can always do `iframe.appendChild(element); element.requestFullscreen()`. Crazy, but I think avoiding a tab-wide set of fullscreen elements that don't form a simple ancestor-descendant chain was the original reason for this.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
