    "updated_at": "2016-07-13T14:21:55Z",
    "body": "Oh, smart, okay, that makes sense.\n\nSo Gecko doesn't have such check, and it seems Safari doesn't either. Not sure Edge's status (I'm not on Windows currently), but I guess it does make sense to remove this restriction if it makes implementation easier.\n\n(But that makes me wonder whether that could make current implementations crazy somehow... Hopefully no security issue exposed...)\n",
